From: Sayzal28 <Sayzal28@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:46:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Keep the African jaw corners when a face is joined onto an
 outfit.

The join shaved the face to the outfit's outline just above the neck. The African face is wider than that outline, so a wedge was cut from each jaw corner. Where the outfit is empty or only a soft edge there, the face now keeps its own pixel. The browser plate cache tag goes up so stored joins are made again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
